      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AFB8C6B0C6B0C6B0C6B8002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "피그킹이\n사이코키네시스를 사용했다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D53CADF8D0B9C774000AC0ACC774CF54D0A4B124C2DCC2A4B97C0020C0ACC6A9D588B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갑자기 파티를 하게 돼서\n음료수가 엄청 많이 필요하거든?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n맛있는물 65개, 미네랄사이다 23개,\n후르츠밀크 28개, 튼튼밀크 31개.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이렇게 부탁할게!\n서둘러야 하니까 빨리 준비해 줘!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "45700원입니다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00340035003700300030C6D0C785B2C8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "46900원입니다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00340036003900300030C6D0C785B2C8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "47900원입니다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00340037003900300030C6D0C785B2C8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "48700원입니다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00340038003700300030C6D0C785B2C8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "49700원입니다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00340039003700300030C6D0C785B2C8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너, 완전 계산 천재구나!\n다음에 또 올 테니까 잘 부탁해!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002C0020C644C8040020ACC4C0B00020CC9CC7ACAD6CB0980021000AB2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020C62C0020D14CB2C8AE4C0020C7980020BD80D0C1D57400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이거 좀 실망인걸?\n다음에 또 올 테니까 그때는 잘 부탁해.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC700020C8800020C2E4B9DDC778AC78003F000AB2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020C62C0020D14CB2C8AE4C0020ADF8B54CB2940020C7980020BD80D0C1D574002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수고했어!\n맡아 줘서 고마워.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218ACE0D588C5B40021000AB9E1C5440020C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 재고와 매상을 확인해 볼까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C7ACACE0C6400020B9E4C0C1C7440020D655C778D5740020BCFCAE4C003F00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이런... 점원에는 소질이 없나 보네.\n랭크로 따지면 Z랭크야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7F0002E002E002E0020C810C6D0C5D0B2940020C18CC9C8C7740020C5C6B0980020BCF4B124002E000AB7ADD06CB85C0020B530C9C0BA740020005AB7ADD06CC57C002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으음...\n역시 갑자기 점원을 맡는 건 어렵나 보네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73CC74C002E002E002E000AC5EDC2DC0020AC11C790AE300020C810C6D0C7440020B9E1B2940020AC740020C5B4B835B0980020BCF4B124002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "점원을 계속하기에는 조금 어렵겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C810C6D0C7440020ACC4C18DD558AE30C5D0B2940020C870AE080020C5B4B835ACA0C5B4002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 점원으로는 보통 수준인 것 같네.\n보통이기도 쉽지 않지만.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020C810C6D0C73CB85CB2940020BCF4D1B50020C218C900C7780020AC830020AC19B124002E000ABCF4D1B5C774AE30B3C40020C27DC9C00020C54AC9C0B9CC002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제법 우수한 점원이었던 것 같네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CBC950020C6B0C218D55C0020C810C6D0C774C5C8B3580020AC830020AC19B124002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "세상에나!\n나의 점원 라이벌이 탄생한 것 같은데!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C138C0C1C5D0B0980021000AB098C7580020C810C6D00020B77CC774BC8CC7740020D0C4C0DDD55C0020AC830020AC19C740B370002100100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n보너스로 <U+0010><U+0003>Ȅ<U+0002><U+0000>원을 받았다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000010000219000001000ABCF4B108C2A4B85C002000100003020400020000C6D0C7440020BC1BC558B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니나 다를까, 혼자 있던 드니꽁이\n집을 냉동고로 만들어 놨지 뭐야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8B0980020B2E4B97CAE4C002C0020D63CC7900020C788B3580020B4DCB2C8AF41C774000AC9D1C7440020B0C9B3D9ACE0B85C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B1A8C9C00020BB50C57C002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼 도와줘서 고마워!\n다음엔 손님으로 들러 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC0020B3C4C640C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC0021000AB2E4C74CC5D40020C190B2D8C73CB85C0020B4E4B7EC0020C918002100100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손님이 없는 동안\n상품의 가격을 확인해 두겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C190B2D8C7740020C5C6B2940020B3D9C548000AC0C1D488C7580020AC00ACA9C7440020D655C778D5740020B450ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "확인한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D655C778D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "확인하지 않는다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D655C778D558C9C00020C54AB294B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맛있는물 200원.\n미네랄사이다 300원.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n후르츠밀크 400원.\n튼튼밀크 600원.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 4168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DBC788B294BB3C0020003200300030C6D0002E000ABBF8B124B784C0ACC774B2E40020003300300030C6D0002E00100001BE01000AD6C4B974CE20BC00D06C0020003400300030C6D0002E000AD2BCD2BCBC00D06C0020003600300030C6D0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
